WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.132
Upstream work is now mostly AI driven, but downstream work is still manual.

00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:06.688
That's a false economy.

00:00:06.738 --> 00:00:07.538
The fix:

00:00:07.564 --> 00:00:08.386
trigger bots,

00:00:08.436 --> 00:00:10.403
automatic bots and schedule bots,

00:00:10.453 --> 00:00:12.682
freeing people for new skills.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:16.772
Picture the team buried in TV bookings and reconciliations,

00:00:16.822 --> 00:00:19.237
slogging through it all by hand.

00:00:19.933 --> 00:00:21.569
Then the bots take over.

00:00:21.619 --> 00:00:22.855
An email lands,

00:00:22.905 --> 00:00:24.010
a trigger bot starts,

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:24.860
an automatic bot acts,

00:00:24.237 --> 00:00:25.402
a schedule bot runs overnight.

00:00:25.452 --> 00:00:30.555
About two hundred and seven thousand hours saved.

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:32.443
Use it like this:

00:00:32.493 --> 00:00:33.693
find the manual work,

00:00:33.743 --> 00:00:34.543
pick the bot,

00:00:34.522 --> 00:00:35.993
and move people into data,

00:00:36.043 --> 00:00:38.857
creative and strategic thinking.
